^Kubernetes e2e suite (\[sig-apps\] Daemon set should run and stop complex daemon \[Conformance\] \[Serial\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] AdmissionWebhook \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should mutate custom resource with different stored version \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] Discovery should validate PreferredVersion for each APIGroup \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] StorageVersionMigration CRUD Tests storagemigration\.k8s\.io/v1 StorageVersionMigration \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] Job should apply changes to a job status \[Conformance\]|\[sig-auth\] Certificates API \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should support CSR API operations \[Conformance\]|\[sig-cli\] Kubectl client Kubectl expose should create services for rc \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] Endpoints should test the lifecycle of an Endpoint \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] ConfigMap should be consumable via environment variable \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Kubelet when scheduling a busybox command that always fails in a pod should be possible to delete \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] Probing container should be restarted with a /healthz http liveness probe \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] \[DRA\] CRUD Tests resource\.k8s\.io/v1 DeviceClass \[Conformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Downward API volume should update labels on modification \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Projected downwardAPI should provide container's memory request \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] VolumeAttributesClass \[FeatureGate:VolumeAttributesClass\] should run through the lifecycle of a VolumeAttributesClass \[Conformance\])$
